msgid "Preserve original download names"
msgstr "Pertahankan nama unduhan asli"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1118
msgid ""
"Use the original document filename inside your chosen folders. Unsafe "
"characters are removed and duplicate names get a number."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan nama file dokumen asli di folder pilihan Anda. Karakter yang tidak "
"aman dihapus dan nama duplikat diberi nomor."

