"ruang disk. Biarkan ponsel online selama pemulihan. Sebagian pesan atau file "
"lama mungkin tidak tersedia."

#: src/ui/login.rs:395
msgid ""
"Recent history starts with recent conversations for a quicker setup. You can "
"enable older-history recovery later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Riwayat terbaru dimulai dari percakapan terbaru agar pengaturan lebih cepat. "
"Pemulihan riwayat lama dapat diaktifkan nanti di Setelan."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:19
msgid "Restore an account backup"
msgstr "Pulihkan cadangan akun"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:21
msgid "Back up this account"
msgstr "Cadangkan akun ini"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:27
msgid "Merge messages into this account"
msgstr "Gabungkan pesan ke akun ini"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:30
msgid ""
"A matching account identity and an exact preview are required. Current "
"messages and work queues stay intact. Conflicting edits and imported pending "
"work are retained separately without sending."
msgstr ""
"Identitas akun yang cocok dan pratinjau yang tepat diperlukan. Pesan dan "
"antrean kerja saat ini tetap utuh. Suntingan yang bertentangan dan pekerjaan "
"tertunda yang diimpor disimpan secara terpisah tanpa mengirim apa pun."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:34
msgid ""
"Merge historical messages and files. The current linked-device identity "
"stays in use."
msgstr ""
"Gabungkan pesan dan file historis. Identitas perangkat tertaut saat ini "
"tetap digunakan."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:36
msgid ""
"Restore into a separate account. Existing accounts stay intact. Full backups "
"include the linked-device identity; archive-only backups open offline."
msgstr ""
"Pulihkan ke akun terpisah. Akun yang sudah ada tetap utuh. Cadangan lengkap "
"mencakup identitas perangkat tertaut; cadangan khusus arsip dibuka offline."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:38
msgid ""
"Save this account, its linked-device identity and downloaded files in an "
"encrypted backup. The connection pauses while saving. Keep the passphrase "
"safe: it cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Simpan akun ini, identitas perangkat tertaut, dan file unduhan dalam "
"cadangan terenkripsi. Koneksi dijeda selama penyimpanan. Simpan frasa sandi "
"dengan aman: frasa tersebut tidak dapat dipulihkan."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:43 src/ui/archive_backup.rs:63
msgid "Backup passphrase (at least 12 characters)"
msgstr "Frasa sandi cadangan (minimal 12 karakter)"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:51
msgid "Repeat passphrase"
msgstr "Ulangi frasa sandi"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:66
msgid "Passphrases do not match."
msgstr "Kata sandi tidak cocok."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:78
msgid "Choose backup…"
msgstr "Pilih cadangan…"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:80
msgid "Save backup…"
msgstr "Simpan cadangan…"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:112
msgid "Merge this backup?"
msgstr "Gabungkan cadangan ini?"

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:113
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"{added} messages added, {edited} edited snapshots updated. {removed} current "
"messages removed by confirmed backup deletions. {protected} deleted or "
"pending-deletion messages are protected. {conflicts} conflicting "
"alternatives and {pending} imported pending records are retained separately."
msgstr ""
"{added} pesan ditambahkan, {edited} versi suntingan diperbarui. {removed} "
"pesan saat ini dihapus oleh penghapusan terkonfirmasi dalam cadangan. "
"{protected} pesan yang dihapus atau menunggu penghapusan dilindungi. "
"{conflicts} alternatif yang bertentangan dan {pending} catatan tertunda yang "
"diimpor disimpan secara terpisah."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:117
msgid ""
"Session credentials and current pending work are preserved. Confirmed backup "
"deletions listed above are applied. Imported pending sends never run. "
"Different edited snapshots without a revision timestamp keep the current "
"version and retain the imported alternative in the encrypted archive."
msgstr ""
"Kredensial sesi dan pekerjaan tertunda saat ini tetap dipertahankan. "
"Penghapusan yang dikonfirmasi dari cadangan dan tercantum di atas akan "
"diterapkan. Pengiriman tertunda yang diimpor tidak pernah dijalankan. Versi "
"suntingan berbeda tanpa stempel waktu revisi mempertahankan versi saat ini "
"dan menyimpan alternatif yang diimpor di arsip terenkripsi."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:120
msgid ""
"If the current archive changes before confirmation, prepare a new preview."
msgstr ""
"Jika arsip saat ini berubah sebelum konfirmasi, siapkan pratinjau baru."

#: src/ui/archive_backup.rs:123
msgid "Merge"
msgstr "Gabungkan"

